{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓國天團BIGBANG今晚（13日）起於香港啟德主場館舉行四場《BIGBANG 2026 WORLD TOUR》世界巡迴演唱會香港站，三子以一身黑白色造型登場，跳唱歌曲〈Fantastic Baby〉打頭陣，引來全場尖叫聲不斷，大批粉絲更興奮地站起來與偶像一起跳唱，現場氣氛非常熱烈！</p><figure><img alt=\"BIGBANG演唱會香港站開鑼！\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1198038282383265792284907.jpeg/vWO2sKUbf1iL8eZum0Fitdbl7QZ_61_XPlBsOT5QbDk\"/><figcaption>BIGBANG演唱會香港站開鑼！</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"太陽。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1198038280160153600019687.jpeg/OqhGdqxSCX-T3L9ahsE1V4MVJ61WEKOoZ_kOEmf5DhI\"/><figcaption>太陽。</figcaption></figure><p>BIGBANG成員大聲和太陽用廣東話跟全場粉絲打招呼，大聲表示：「香港朋友好嗎？尖叫再大聲啲！」而太陽就表示：「大家好，我係太陽！Nice to meet you again！」G-Dragon（GD）則以英文跟觀眾打招呼，他在彈結他演唱期間，更突然猛力掟結他，場面震撼！</p><figure><img alt=\"型爆登場！\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1198038275680374784184539.jpeg/IscQCeA0gf0T63cumFahGbAywDUymmqORF1_U0Rdf1M\"/><figcaption>型爆登場！</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"氣氛熱烈！\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1198038277907681280672534.jpeg/mj0bWju7X0KiEvcMxTfjuyrCYOjxMU9pCd7cWQne3Fk\"/><figcaption>氣氛熱烈！</figcaption></figure><p>此外，場內官方周邊商品今早11時開始安檢前已有數百名粉絲在園區排隊等候購買官方紀念品，現場人流管理及分流安排良好，大獲樂迷讚賞。選購周邊後，觀眾更可前往中央廣場參觀三個巨型主題打卡裝置，與同行好友留下演唱會前的難忘回憶。</p><figure><img alt=\"現場安排良好。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1198041557778173952580671.jpeg/ftBnLQ991P-fHGdRqA7wO_LPq1UL5xjkDnn7XA55-1w\"/><figcaption>現場安排良好。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大獲樂迷讚賞。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1198041548231544832583472.jpeg/vhbsxVTm3fC9qYkJok0s4w_fjOXhC5ved3Ql5nd0JeY\"/><figcaption>大獲樂迷讚賞。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"官方紀念品。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1198041551754891264324059.jpeg/i4HaaprjbAlcr8RxBsZNZqjp_YXHHNR8fA6ElnwOhJY\"/><figcaption>官方紀念品。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"官方紀念品。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1198041561070833664012596.jpeg/MtuUrpn-854Wzu0rCerMPIx4suZt98oNCIF9FAiBfRQ\"/><figcaption>官方紀念品。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"官方紀念品。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1198041554686840832318027.jpeg/xGlHfMllb9KNGbeCcLEubg3bAB9FHkgY2zz0pNs89KQ\"/><figcaption>官方紀念品。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T15:03:23.030778+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":460,"images":9,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T14:40:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T20:41:10.673616+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T14:56:39.601829+00:00","content_hash":"0aa71ea4a30c2c0b99b24cf463c44dcd25838736b03edbca8e7514306daa0e5b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}